# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored).
#
# Both values are PUBLIC and end up in the JavaScript bundle — that is what
# the VITE_ prefix means. The anon key is designed for this; it is safe only
# because every table has a Row Level Security policy.
#
# Never put a service-role key or a vendor API key here. Anything with a
# VITE_ prefix is shipped to the browser.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54421
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Get the local anon key from: supabase status
